   <a href="/termasromanas"><span class="auto-style15">
   Termas Romanas</span></a></p></div><div class="migrated-cell">
   <img src="/images/segobriga/casa griego/casa_griego_segobriga.JPG" alt=""></div><div class="migrated-cell">
   <img src="/images/segobriga/casa_julio_silvano_aerea.jpg" alt=""></div><div class="migrated-cell">
   Foto: <i>
   <a href="http://www.cultura.castillalamancha.es">
   www.cultura.castillalamancha.es</a> </i></div><div class="migrated-cell">
   <img src="/images/segobriga/circo/circo_segobriga.JPG" alt=""></div><div class="migrated-cell">
   <img src="/images/segobriga/circo/circo_segobriga_01.JPG" alt=""><p>
   <span class="auto-style17">Ver</span><i>
   <span class="auto-style17"> <a href="/circosromanos">
